Package: aiwindow
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: python3, openssl
Maintainer: aiwindow dev <dev@localhost>
Description: Lightweight selection AI assistant for LoongArch64 Kylin desktop
 A minimal floating-selection AI assistant built purely on Python standard
 library (no PySide6/FastAPI/PyInstaller): GTK3 single-window dual-form
 floating ball (collapsed = ball only / expanded = ball + chat panel in the
 same top-level window) + in-process module backend (SQLite storage with
 AES-encrypted cloud API key, urllib cloud forwarding, no HTTP server / no
 port). Pure-GUI desktop edition: expanded panel embeds a "Settings" page
 (edit API key / base_url / model / timeout, persist to SQLite, show version
 and Zhipu provider info, list call logs); chat calls backend.handle_chat
 in-process; only Zhipu GLM-4.7-Flash cloud mode (default
 base_url=https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4, model=glm-4.7-flash).
 v1.6.0 adds background residence: closing the floating window (delete-event /
 Alt+F4 / WM close) only hides it instead of quitting, with a system tray icon
 (click to toggle, right-click menu to show/quit) and a "Quit" button on the
 Settings page (with confirmation) as the real exit entry. Desktop autostart
 launches the floating window GUI; systemd service initializes data when
 headless and is enabled at boot (multi-user.target). Zero pip dependencies;
 fully offline build.
 .
 zh: 轻量化划词 AI 助手（龙芯版，仅 Python 标准库，解压即用）。
